/snowfall is likely at one or two places in the Himalayan and hilly regions of Koshi and Bagmati Provinces  .      "}},{"label":{"ne":"भोलि","en":"Tomorrow"},"text":{"ne":" देशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागमा साधारणतया बादल लाग्ने साथै देशको  तराई भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ। कोशी र बागमती प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागको थोरै स्थानमा, गण्डकी, लुम्बिनी, कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको  हिमाली  र पहाडी भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा हल्का वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ ।","en":"  Generally cloudy conditions will prevail in the Himalayan and hilly regions of the country, while partly cloudy conditions will prevail in the Terai regions of the country. Light rain/snowfall is likely at a few places in the Himalayan and hilly regions of Koshi and Bagmati Provinces, and at one or two places in the Himalayan and hilly regions of Gandaki, Lumbini, Karnali, and Sudurpashchim Provinces.      "}}]}],"model_issued":[]}